<v Host>The old wooden buildings were close together, so the fire spread, and eighty-seven shops burned down.

00:03:33.132 --> 00:03:35.460
<v Vocab>広がる

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.716
<v Host>It means to spread, or to get wider.

00:03:39.316 --> 00:03:41.500
<v Vocab>焼ける

